  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recovering from Conflict: Integrated Support for Most Vulnerable Communities in South Kordofan-UNTFHS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the objective of the two-year programme is to stimulate a smooth transition towards
stabilization in both localities, and break the after-effects of conflict while paving the way for local
sustainable development and environment conducive to self-sustainable economy.
Restored human dignity and self-sufficiency for vulnerable population in Dalami and Abu
Kershola localities</narrative>
  </description>
